%% D2 M2.6 — termination sequence
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API server
    participant EP as endpoint controller
    participant KP as kube-proxy (every node)
    participant K as kubelet
    participant APP as payment-service

    API->>API: pod marked Terminating
    par in parallel
        API->>EP: pod is terminating
        EP->>EP: remove from EndpointSlice
        EP->>KP: watch fires
        KP->>KP: reprogram iptables
    and
        API->>K: begin termination
        K->>APP: run preStop  (sleep 8)
        Note over K,APP: the pause exists so endpoint removal<br/>can propagate to EVERY node first
        K->>APP: SIGTERM
        APP->>APP: mark unready, finish in-flight payments
        APP-->>K: exit 0
    end
    Note over K: if still alive at 45s → SIGKILL
